+ * uncached mapping, its line of the cached mapping cleaned + invalidated first: without that (0192 as built) the
+ * uncached read kept returning a stale copy (mismatched aliases: the cached line hits), the firmware's answers on RX
+ * ring 1 were never seen and "wifi fw" failed at region 1 (0193, phone: rx1 didx 2, driver waiting at 1).
